B.Ls=s(["Choose a light pin and adjust the thigh pad so it holds you down with feet flat.","Grip the wide bar a little beyond shoulder-width and sit with your chest gently lifted.","Pull the bar toward your collarbone by bringing your elbows down beside your ribs.","Pause near your upper chest, then let your arms reach long overhead without losing the seat."],t.s)
