B.Lt=s(["Set the assistance pin to give plenty of help. More stack weight makes the pull-up easier.","Climb the steps, take an overhand grip, and place one knee at a time on the moving pad.","Start with long arms and a quiet body, keeping your shoulders away from your ears.","Pull your chest toward the handles until your chin reaches hand height, then lower slowly."],t.s)
