B.jf=s(["bodyweight-reverse-lunge"],t.s)
B.LT=s(["Clip a rope to the lowest cable setting and choose a light pin.","Face away, straddle the rope, and hold one rope end in each hand.","Walk forward until the cable stays taut, then soften your knees and push your hips back.","Let the rope pass between your legs, then squeeze your glutes to stand tall."],t.s)
