B.Mj=s(["Keep your feet hip-width apart so you have a stable base.","Lean your chest forward a little to load the front glute.","Push the front foot down instead of springing off the back toes."],t.s)
B.Ml=s(["Anchor the bench so it cannot slide behind you.","Keep your shins close to upright at the top.","Pause and squeeze your glutes before lowering."],t.s)
B.Mm=s(["Do not set the bench almost upright; that turns this into a shoulder press.","Do not flare your elbows straight out from your body.","Do not drop the weights faster than you can guide them."],t.s)
B.Mn=s(["Set a flat bench against a wall and sit with the bottom of your shoulder blades on its edge.","Place one dumbbell lengthwise across your hip creases and hold it at both ends.","Plant your feet hip-width apart and tuck your chin so you look toward your knees.","Push the floor away, lift your hips to knee height, pause, then lower."],t.s)
B.Mo=s(["Lie on a mat with knees bent, feet flat, and heels a comfortable distance from your hips.","Place one dumbbell across your hip creases and hold both ends so it stays centered.","Let your ribs settle down, then press through both feet to lift your hips.","Stop when knees, hips, and shoulders form a line, squeeze, then lower softly."],t.s)
B.Mp=s(["Do not hold your breath to survive the last seconds.","Do not let your hips sag below your shoulders.","Do not lift your hips high to take the work off your abs."],t.s)
